# Railway upload ignore — keep the deploy context small and secret-free.
# NOTE: database/*.db* and backups are EXCLUDED on purpose. On first boot the
# Dockerfile CMD runs `npm run init-db` and the ~45 idempotent seeds inside
# src/app.js rebuild the schema + demo data from scratch. The /app/database
# volume then persists it across redeploys.
.env
scratch/
audit-evidence/
DELIVERY/
docs/
backups/
database/backups/
database/*.db
database/*.db-shm
database/*.db-wal
database/demo-snapshot/
uploads/
node_modules/
.git/
*.log
npmci*.log
